  "description": "Jihwan, known as \"Bread Shuttle,\" who was bullied in high school, harbors a desire for revenge against Kim Min-ji, the \"bully\" who tormented him, leading to the kidnapping and confining her. Taged by web novel fever, modern teaching assistant revenge, regret, and obsessive fixation on the devastation of the original Novelpia bully.\n\n\n[Original Novel](https://novelpia.com/novel/101503)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Novelpia](https://novelpia.com/comic_episode/125)  \nR15: [Novelpia](https://novelpia.com/comic_episode/319)",
